      "Make Masks corrects masks by hand and carries the Cellpose loop on its masthead. Its canvas has ten tools: Brush, Erase, Erase object, Wand, Draw, Box, Divide / Merge, Zoom, Recrop and Ruler. Wand adds a region by default; hold Ctrl while clicking to remove it. The :doc:`Make Masks reference <make_masks>` covers these tools, Levels, detection settings, primary/secondary pairing, saving and measurement."
